	(text "PMODE set to PWM mode with IN1 / IN2 signals\nIMODE set to mode 4: fixed off time current chopping, overcurrent latches output off and reports a fault\n  Itrip (A) = 1000 * Vref (V) / Rpropi (Ω) = 1 A\nNSLEEP activates motor when high\nNFAULT is open-drain\n\nInternal pull-down on NSLEEP, IN1, IN2"
